      "value": "its suspected this glitched instance was made through the use of clients, but i dont have the evidence to back it up, i wouldnt know how to get evidence\n\nfurther information is:\n\nThe glitched group instance in the large menu just mimics the last group instance you looked at, otherwise just says \"Owner\" if its the only instance you've seen first",
