  "details": "with a current rise of group instances, and game worlds\n\nYou might want to shut down a specific bad group's instance, if its racist or bad behaviour.\n\nOr, you might want to shut down all the instances in your game world, to get ready for an update, so everyone is forced to create new instances of your newly updated game, instead of new version players joining on an old version instance, and corrupting it.\n\nRoblox already does this, so i dont think vrchat would have much harm in it.\n\nit could also fix something like this:\n\n(Vid will be attached for example of glitched instance)\n\nThe milkyway *Has* made the 2 player instance, shown in video, as i can click on the group and see it.\n\n'The milkyway' has not made *this* instance im in, as i cannot click on it, and the hand menu does not show 'the milkyway' as the group that owns the instance.\n\nit would be helpful to fix this broken instance by shutting it down forcibly",
